            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ebyo mwangambiire Omukama akabihulira. Aho wenene Ruhanga yangambira ati, ‘Eby'abantu aba bakugambira nabihulira; byona by'amazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabakugizire omutima nk'ogu ebiro byona, kuntina n'okukwata emihango yange yona, bakagira emilembe n'abana babo eirai lyona!’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogende obagambire oti, “Mushube omu mahema ganyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai iwe onyemelere haihi aha, ndakugambira emihango yona n'ebiragiro n'emigenzo eby'orabegesa, baije babigobesheleze omu nsi eyo ndabaha!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo mube begendeleza kukora nk'okwo Omukama Ruhanga wanyu yabaragiire; mutatarambukanira bulyo anga bumosho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutambukire omu muhanda ogw'Omukama Ruhanga wanyu abaragiire murore, mugire emilembe, murore ebiro bingi omu nsi eyo muralya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
